==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Tochigi Prefecture'''.
*Tochigi Prefecture's base is the [https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g298183-d7258073-Reviews-Gyoza_Dumpling_Statue-Utsunomiya_Tochigi_Prefecture_Kanto.html Gyoza Dumpling Statue] in Utsunomiya, Tochigi. The statue is shaped to look like a humanoid version of the city's specialty, [[wikipedia:Jiaozi#Gyōza|''gyoza'']] dumplings.
*Not counting [[Zombie Outbreaks]], this is one of the two [[Empire of Cats]] stages to introduce multiple new enemies in a single chapter. The other is [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea/Nagasaki]], which is technically the first appearance of both [[Doge]] and [[Ms. Sign]].

